    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Hegarty Properties are delighted to present this detached residence situated at Weavers Point, where the ever-changing seascape forms the backdrop to everyday living. Perched in an unrivalled position overlooking the sea, ‘Villaflor’ offers what is becoming increasingly difficult to find – uninterrupted coastal views in one of Cork’s most desirable locations.\r\nFrom sunrise over the harbour to the movement of sailing boats across the water, the outlook is nothing short of spectacular, making this a property where the location truly takes centre stage.\r\nWhile the house itself would benefit from modernisation and refurbishment, it presents an exceptional opportunity for purchasers to create a bespoke coastal home tailored to their own vision. \r\nExtending to approximately 138.32 sq.m. (1,488.86 sq.ft.), the accommodation currently comprises entrance hall, guest W.C., living room, kitchen/dining area, two bedrooms, family bathroom and a converted attic space.\r\nCrosshaven is widely recognised as one of Ireland’s premier coastal villages, celebrated for its maritime heritage, vibrant community and exceptional lifestyle. Home to the world-famous Royal Cork Yacht Club, the village offers sailing, swimming, scenic coastal walks, beaches, cafés, restaurants and local amenities, all within easy reach. Despite its peaceful setting, Cork Airport, Ringaskiddy, Carrigaline and Cork City are all easily accessible.\r\nThis is a rare chance to secure a home where the panoramic sea views are the defining feature – an opportunity to create something truly special in an exceptional waterfront location.\r\n\r\nGuide Price: €595,000"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor\r\nEntrance Hall:       \t Hallway with laminate flooring\r\n\r\nLiving Room: \tA front aspect reception room with carpet flooring and open fire place. \r\n                  \r\nKitchen/Dining:  \tFully fitted kitchen complete with double oven, fridge/freezer and open fireplace. Sliding doors open directly onto the terrace.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1:\tDouble room to the front with carpet flooring.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2:\tDouble room to the front with carpet flooring.\r\n\r\nBathroom:\t               Fully fitted with W.C., wash hand basin, bath and electric shower.\r\n\r\nFirst Floor \t\t\r\nConverted Attic Space:\r\nA versatile converted attic currently utilised as additional accommodation and storage, offering excellent flexibility for a variety of uses subject to purchasers' own requirements.\r\n\r\nOutside:  \tThe property enjoys private gardens together with off-street parking and side access. However, it is the elevated position and uninterrupted outlook over the water that make this home truly unique. Whether enjoyed from the living spaces or while relaxing outdoors, the spectacular coastal panorama provides an ever-changing backdrop throughout the seasons."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tExceptional waterfront position with uninterrupted sea views\r\n•\tRare opportunity to renovate and create a dream coastal home\r\n•\tDetached residence extending to approximately 138.32 sq.m. (1,488.86 sq.ft.)\r\n•\tPrivate gardens with outstanding outlook\r\n•\tOff-street parking\r\n•\tDouble glazed windows\r\n•\tMains water and mains drainage\r\n•\tPrime location in the heart of Crosshaven, on a Cul de Sac\r\n•\tWalking distance to the village, marina, cafés and coastal amenities\r\n•\tBER: E1 | BER No. 114645914"
